---
// PlatformSection.astro - Seção 2: O que é a Pluri Health (3 Versões com Pesquisas Reais e WebP Otimizado)
---

<section
  id="plataforma"
  aria-labelledby="plataforma-titulo"
  class="snap-page platform-section"
>
  <!-- Visualizador com Alternância entre as 3 Versões da Seção 2 -->
  <div class="platform-text-box" id="platformTextBox">
    
    <!-- Controles de Alternância (Setas < e > e indicador de versão) -->
    <div class="platform-mode-switch" aria-label="Alternar versão da seção">
      <div class="mode-switch-left">
        <span class="mode-counter" id="platformModeCounter">1/3</span>
        <span class="mode-label" id="platformModeLabel">Opção 1: Pesquisas + Foto Vertical</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mode-nav-arrows">
        <button
          type="button"
          id="btnPrevPlatformMode"
          class="btn-arrow-toggle"
          title="Versão anterior"
          aria-label="Versão anterior"
        >
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          id="btnNextPlatformMode"
          class="btn-arrow-toggle"
          title="Próxima versão"
          aria-label="Próxima versão"
        >
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- VERSÃO 1 (Ativa): Pesquisas Expandidas + Foto Vertical Humana da Rotina -->
    <div class="platform-view platform-view-v1 active" id="platformViewV1">
      <span class="platform-kicker">O custo invisível da desorganização</span>
      <h2 id="plataforma-titulo" class="t-title platform-title platform-title-conversion">
        A clínica não fecha por falta de técnica. Fecha por má gestão.
      </h2>
      <p class="t-lead platform-lead">
        Fichas em papel, planilhas soltas e WhatsApp pessoal drenam o faturamento e a sanidade do fisioterapeuta todos os meses.
      </p>

      <!-- Cards de Evidências Reais com Tags Sóbrias e Elegantes -->
      <div class="research-evidence-grid">
        <div class="evidence-card">
          <div class="evidence-stat-header">
            <span class="stat-number">60%</span>
            <span class="stat-badge stat-badge-sobriety">Sustentabilidade</span>
          </div>
          <p class="evidence-text">
            das clínicas e consultórios de saúde no Brasil <strong>fecham em até 5 anos</strong> por deficiência no controle financeiro e processos manuais.
          </p>
          <a
            href="https://saudeempreende.com.br"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="evidence-source-link"
          >
            Fonte: Levantamento Sebrae
            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path>
              <polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline>
              <line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"></line>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="evidence-card">
          <div class="evidence-stat-header">
            <span class="stat-number">2h</span>
            <span class="stat-badge stat-badge-time">Tempo Clínico</span>
          </div>
          <p class="evidence-text">
            gastas em burocracias e prontuários <strong>para cada 1h atendendo</strong> pacientes, forçando horas extras em casa à noite.
          </p>
          <a
            href="https://www.acpjournals.org/doi/10.7326/M16-0961"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="evidence-source-link"
          >
            Estudo: Annals of Internal Medicine
            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path>
              <polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline>
              <line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"></line>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Solução do Pluri Fisio -->
      <div class="solution-reassurance">
        <span class="reassurance-tag">Como o Pluri Fisio protege sua rotina:</span>
        <ul class="reassurance-list">
          <li>
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span><strong>Evolução em 40s:</strong> reaproveite a conduta anterior e anote apenas o que mudou.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span><strong>Pacotes e Financeiro amarrados:</strong> zero atendimentos esquecidos sem cobrança.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="conversion-actions">
        <a href="#planos" class="btn-clay platform-cta-primary">
          Proteger minha clínica com 20 atendimentos grátis
          <svg aria-hidden="true" class="icon-arrow" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <span class="cta-micro-guarantee">Sem cartão • Importação grátis de fichas antigas de papel</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- VERSÃO 2: Cards com Imagem Individual Dedicada para Cada Pesquisa (Largura Total sem lateral) -->
    <div class="platform-view platform-view-v2" id="platformViewV2">
      <div class="v2-header-block">
        <span class="platform-kicker">Evidências científicas e de mercado</span>
        <h2 class="t-title v2-section-title">
          A dor da gestão e o custo do tempo em números reais.
        </h2>
        <p class="v2-section-lead">
          Veja por que sistemas amadores, anotações em papel e desorganização financeira ameaçam consultórios de saúde:
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 2 Blocos Grandes com Imagens Próprias de Alto Impacto (WebP Otimizado) -->
      <div class="split-research-cards">
        <div class="split-research-card">
          <div class="split-card-media">
            <picture>
              <source srcset="/images/research_finance_cards.webp" type="image/webp" />
              <img
                src="/images/research_finance_cards.jpg"
                alt="Mesa de clínica com faturas manuais e aplicativo financeiro com indicadores verdes"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
                width="1280"
                height="720"
                class="split-media-img"
              />
            </picture>
          </div>
          <div class="split-card-content">
            <div class="evidence-stat-header">
              <span class="stat-number">60%</span>
              <span class="stat-badge stat-badge-sobriety">Sustentabilidade Clínica</span>
            </div>
            <p class="evidence-text v2-evidence-text">
              das clínicas e consultórios de saúde no Brasil <strong>fecham suas portas em até 5 anos</strong> por deficiências no controle financeiro, fluxo de caixa e gestão de agendamentos.
            </p>
            <a href="https://saudeempreende.com.br" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="evidence-source-link">
              Levantamento Sebrae Nacional
              <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"></line></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="split-research-card">
          <div class="split-card-media">
            <picture>
              <source srcset="/images/research_clock_time.webp" type="image/webp" />
              <img
                src="/images/research_clock_time.jpg"
                alt="Relógio de mesa marcando após 20h na clínica com prontuários de papel e smartphone com evolução rápida"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
                width="1280"
                height="720"
                class="split-media-img"
              />
            </picture>
          </div>
          <div class="split-card-content">
            <div class="evidence-stat-header">
              <span class="stat-number">2h</span>
              <span class="stat-badge stat-badge-time">Tempo & Sobrecarga</span>
            </div>
            <p class="evidence-text v2-evidence-text">
              gastas em prontuários e tarefas burocráticas <strong>para cada 1h de consulta clínica</strong>, forçando mais de 1 a 2 horas extras de trabalho não remunerado em casa à noite.
            </p>
            <a href="https://www.acpjournals.org/doi/10.7326/M16-0961" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="evidence-source-link">
              Estudo: Annals of Internal Medicine
              <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"></line></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="conversion-actions v2-center-actions">
        <a href="#planos" class="btn-clay platform-cta-primary">
          Eliminar a sobrecarga com 20 atendimentos grátis
          <svg aria-hidden="true" class="icon-arrow" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <span class="cta-micro-guarantee">Prontuário, agenda e financeiro em 1 só lugar • Sem cartão de crédito</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- VERSÃO 3: Minimalista Original (Toda a clínica. Um sistema.) -->
    <div class="platform-view platform-view-v3" id="platformViewV3">
      <h2 class="t-title platform-title">
        Toda a clínica. Um sistema.
      </h2>
      <p class="t-lead platform-lead">
        Prontuário, agenda e financeiro conversando entre si — sem planilhas, sem retrabalho.
      </p>
      <a href="#planos" class="btn-primary btn-primary-hoverable t-small platform-cta">
        Ver planos 
        <svg aria-hidden="true" class="icon-arrow" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
          <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Caixa de Imagem Lateral Responsiva com WebP Otimizado -->
  <div class="platform-image-box" id="platformImageBox">
    <picture>
      <source srcset="/images/fisio_routine_vertical.webp" type="image/webp" />
      <img
        id="platformImgV1"
        src="/images/fisio_routine_vertical.jpg"
        alt="Fisioterapeuta em consultório moderno utilizando o aplicativo com tranquilidade"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
        width="1200"
        height="1600"
        class="platform-img platform-img-toggle active"
      />
    </picture>
    <picture>
      <source srcset="/images/platform_tablet_blue.webp" type="image/webp" />
      <img
        id="platformImgV3"
        src="/images/platform_tablet_blue.jpg"
        alt="Painel da Pluri Health exibido em um tablet"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
        width="1408"
        height="1408"
        class="platform-img platform-img-toggle"
      />
    </picture>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .platform-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: 1fr auto;
    background-color: var(--background);
    padding-top: 3.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .platform-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
      grid-template-rows: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .platform-text-box {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding-inline: max(1.5rem, 6vmin);
    padding-block: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vmin, 3.5rem);
    position: relative;
    overflow-y: auto;
  }

  .platform-mode-switch {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: clamp(0.85rem, 1.8vmin, 1.4rem);
    padding-bottom: 0.65rem;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .mode-switch-left {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .mode-counter {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
  }

  .mode-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--clay);
    background: rgba(0, 114, 255, 0.08);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .mode-nav-arrows {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .btn-arrow-toggle {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    color: var(--foreground);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .btn-arrow-toggle:hover {
    background: var(--foreground);
    color: var(--bone);
    border-color: var(--foreground);
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .platform-view {
    display: none;
    flex-direction: column;
    animation: fadeInView 0.3s ease forwards;
  }

  .platform-view.active {
    display: flex;
  }

  @keyframes fadeInView {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(6px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  .platform-kicker {
    font-size: clamp(0.75rem, 1.4vmin, 0.88rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--clay);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .platform-title-conversion {
    max-width: 16ch;
    font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4.8vmin, 3.4rem);
    line-height: 1.08;
    color: var(--foreground);
  }

  .platform-lead {
    max-width: 42ch;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
    font-size: clamp(0.92rem, 1.8vmin, 1.1rem);
  }

  .platform-view-v1 {
    gap: clamp(0.75rem, 1.6vmin, 1.25rem);
  }

  .research-evidence-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-block: 0.2rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .research-evidence-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
  }

  .evidence-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: clamp(0.85rem, 1.8vmin, 1.15rem);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .evidence-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  }

  .evidence-stat-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .stat-number {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.5vmin, 2.2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--foreground);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
  }

  .stat-badge {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .stat-badge-sobriety {
    background: #fef3c7;
    color: #92400e;
    border: 1px solid #fde68a;
  }

  .stat-badge-time {
    background: #eff6ff;
    color: #1d4ed8;
    border: 1px solid #dbeafe;
  }

  .evidence-text {
    font-size: clamp(0.78rem, 1.45vmin, 0.88rem);
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .evidence-text strong {
    color: var(--foreground);
  }

  .evidence-source-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--clay);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    opacity: 0.85;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }

  .evidence-source-link:hover {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .solution-reassurance {
    background: rgba(0, 114, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 114, 255, 0.12);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.45rem;
  }

  .reassurance-tag {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--clay);
  }

  .reassurance-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .reassurance-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(0.78rem, 1.4vmin, 0.86rem);
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--foreground);
  }

  .reassurance-list svg {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--clay);
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }

  .platform-section.mode-v2-active {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
  }

  .platform-section.mode-v2-active .platform-image-box {
    display: none !important;
  }

  .platform-section.mode-v2-active .platform-text-box {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    width: 100%;
    padding-inline: max(1.5rem, 5vw);
    padding-block: clamp(1.5rem, 3vmin, 2.5rem);
  }

  .platform-view-v2 {
    gap: clamp(1.2rem, 2.4vmin, 1.8rem);
  }

  .v2-header-block {
    text-align: left;
    max-width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .v2-section-title {
    max-width: 36ch;
    color: var(--foreground);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vmin, 3.2rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  .v2-section-lead {
    font-family: var(--font-accessible);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.85vmin, 1.25rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    letter-spacing: 0.012em;
    word-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    max-width: 68ch;
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }

  .split-research-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: clamp(1.2rem, 2.5vmin, 2rem);
    margin-block: 0.25rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .split-research-cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .split-research-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
    transition: transform 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), box-shadow 0.25s ease;
  }

  .split-research-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .split-card-media {
    height: clamp(150px, 18vmin, 220px);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--sand);
    position: relative;
  }

  .split-media-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.4s ease;
  }

  .split-research-card:hover .split-media-img {
    transform: scale(1.03);
  }

  .split-card-content {
    padding: clamp(1.2rem, 2.2vmin, 1.6rem);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .v2-evidence-text {
    font-family: var(--font-accessible);
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.75vmin, 1.15rem) !important;
    line-height: 1.62 !important;
    letter-spacing: 0.012em;
    word-spacing: 0.03em;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .v2-evidence-text strong {
    color: var(--foreground);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .v2-center-actions {
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
  }

  .conversion-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .platform-cta-primary {
    min-height: 3rem;
    padding-inline: 1.75rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .cta-micro-guarantee {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    padding-left: 0.25rem;
  }

  .platform-view-v3 {
    gap: 2.5vmin;
  }

  .platform-title {
    max-width: 16ch;
    color: var(--foreground);
